ites moms don't forget please  vote  and at the end of the video molly adds  quote we are raising him to fight for  less fortunate kids  americans take care of one another vote  with your heart  six days after open heart surgery we got  to bring him home which is amazing  jimmy who also has two older children  kevin and katie from  a previous relationship first opened up  about his son's condition  in may 2017 with an emotional monologue  on his show they did an echocardiogram  which is a sonogram of the heart and  found that billy was born  with um a heart disease  this is what he looked like on monday  but this is what he looked like um  yesterday  poor kid not only to get a bad heart he  got my face  when e.t caught up with jimmy as he  prepped to host the oscars in 2018  he opened up about how his experience  with billy's health journey changed his  perspective  it makes me more thankful in general for  sure  to be honest it minimizes the importance  of something  like this which last year seemed to me  to be the most important thing in the  world and then you get this  reminder that this is even close to the  most important thing in the world  and you're reminded of that every day  when you go home but so  in a way it yes it definitely has made  me appreciate my life  more it also puts things in perspective
 

